import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---
<ResearchLayout title="Technology｜J 的世界 Research" page="P4">
<div class="editorial-page">
  <div class="page-kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P4</div>
  <div class="page-meta"><span>SIGNAL <b>Technology</b></span><span>EVIDENCE <b>FACTS FIRST</b></span><span>FOCUS <b>AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION</b></span></div>
  <h1 class="page-title">從晶片走向系統</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">AI Compute → Advanced Process → Advanced Packaging → Optical Interconnect → Thermal / Power → System</p>
  <div class="editorial-rule"></div>
  <div class="lead-grid">
    <div class="lead-visual"><div class="visual-label">TECHNOLOGY PATH</div><div class="visual-big">CHIP<br><em>→ SYSTEM</em></div><div class="visual-lines"></div></div>
    <aside class="lead-note"><span class="tag">TECHNOLOGY</span><h2>研究不是預測誰會取代誰，而是追蹤技術何時跨過證據門檻。</h2><p>核心問題是：一項技術何時從「技術可能性」進入驗證、導入與量產。</p></aside>
  </div>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">TECHNOLOGY FLOW</div><h2>從 Compute 到 System</h2></div></div><div class="flow"><div class="flow-node"><b>AI Compute</b><span>算力需求</span></div><div class="flow-node"><b>Advanced Process</b><span>製程節點</span></div><div class="flow-node"><b>Advanced Packaging</b><span>異質整合</span></div><div class="flow-node"><b>Optical</b><span>高速互連</span></div><div class="flow-node"><b>Thermal / Power</b><span>基礎設施</span></div><div class="flow-node"><b>System</b><span>平台</span></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE CHECKPOINTS</div><h2>四個證據門檻</h2></div></div><div class="watch-line"><div class="watch-step"><b>01 · VERIFY</b><h3>驗證</h3><p>技術是否開始被客戶或供應鏈驗證？</p></div><div class="watch-step"><b>02 · ADOPT</b><h3>導入</h3><p>是否進入實際製程或產品設計？</p></div><div class="watch-step"><b>03 · PRODUCE</b><h3>量產</h3><p>是否形成可觀察的產能與營收？</p></div><div class="watch-step"><b>04 · SCALE</b><h3>擴散</h3><p>是否由單一案例擴展至更多平台？</p></div></div></section>
  
</div>
</ResearchLayout>
